    <h4>2. Interest</h4>
    <p>Fast Credit Ltd will charge interest on the loan amount at the rate of 4% per month, and the interest rate will be fixed for a period of the loan. if the borrower fails to pay any month which the Borrower owes Fast Credit Ltd in terms of the agreement on the due date of such amount, Fast Credit Ltd shall be entitled to charge interest on the Borrower has not paid at the same rate as sold in this clause.</p>

    <h4>3. Insurance</h4>
