    <p>6.2 Penalty interest charge shall not exceed the maximum allowable rate in the terms of the notice on overdue amounts in case of deafly by the Borrower or his/her employer.</p>
    <p>6.3 The amount owing by the Borrower for Fast Credit Ltd at any may be shown by a certificate in which a Fast Credit Ltd officer has worked out and stated that amount owing. An officer of Fast Credit Ltd must sign the certificate. The certificate will be proof of the amount owing to Fast Credit Ltd by the Borrower and will be used in any legal proceedings and will be accepted by the court on its own as correct unless the Borrower proves that it is wrong.</p>
